      "id": "born-to-run-ref-1",
      "chapterOrder": 1,
      "title": "Why Did You Stop Playing?",
      "prompt": "Kids sprint until they drop, laugh, and do it again. Adults treat running like a dentist appointment or a calorie-burning chore. When did movement stop feeling like play and turn into work for you?",
