      "title": "Questioning The Cushioned Armor",
      "prompt": "We buy high-tech shoes with chunky foam, air bubbles, and orthotics, yet runners get injured just as much as decades ago. In what other areas of your life are you buying complicated gadgets to solve problems caused by the gadgets themselves?",
