        "label": "Evolutionary Biology & The Running Human",
        "description": "The scientific thesis developed by evolutionary anthropologists Dr. David Carrier, Dr. Dennis Bramble, and Dr. Daniel Lieberman. They argue that Homo sapiens evolved not as ferocious sprinters, but as supreme endurance predators engineered to run down prey.",
